"description":"Join Fresha (formerly Shedul), the world's top-rated booking platform for beauty and wellness. Trusted by 120,000 businesses like yours worldwide, with over 18 million appointments booked every month.\nWHY CHOOSE FRESHA?\n\nManage all of your bookings today and clients from your own online calendar\nGet booked online 24/7 on Facebook, Instagram, and Google Maps\nTake payments in seconds with the Fresha POS. Get paid the very next business day\nReduce no-shows by 89% with upfront payments and cancellation policies\nReach thousands of new clients on the Fresha marketplace\nFill slots fast with powerful marketing tools, from special offers to custom campaigns\nKeep clients in the loop with automated reminders and \"thank you\" messages\nTrack sales, spot trends, and make profitable decisions with intelligent reporting\nStreamline your inventory management and sell products online with ease\nEARN MORE, SAVE TIME, GROW YOUR BUSINESS\nJoin over 450,000 professionals from the world's best salons, spas, and barbershops using Fresha (formerly Shedul) to manage their day, every day. We'll handle your bookings, so you can focus on what you do best: making your clients look and feel great.\nDownload the app now and get started.", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "trackCensoredName":"Fresha for business", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/fresha-for-business/id1455346253?uo=4", "averageUserRating":4.76869000000000031747049433761276304721832275390625, "minimumOsVersion":"16.7", "artistId":1297230800, "artistName":"Fresha.com Holding Inc.", "userRatingCount":3839}, 
